{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"a 14th-century biography (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Mar_Yahballaha_and_Rabban_Sauma\" title=\"History of Mar Yahballaha and Rabban Sauma\">a 14th-century biography</a></b> <i>(page pictured)</i> retells the travels of a monk who was possibly \"the first traveller from China to the Atlantic\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Mar_Yahballaha_and_Rabban_Sauma","retrieved":1787680636213},{"title":"Radu Cioculescu (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radu_Cioculescu\" title=\"Radu Cioculescu\">Radu Cioculescu</a></b> began his Romanian translation of <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/In_Search_of_Lost_Time\" title=\"In Search of Lost Time\">In Search of Lost Time</a></i> while serving on the Eastern Front, where he also witnessed and documented the Holocaust?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radu_Cioculescu","retrieved":1787680636214},{"title":"Videogames for Humans (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the format of the book <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Videogames_for_Humans\" title=\"Videogames for Humans\">Videogames for Humans</a></b></i> has been described as \"<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Let's_Play\" title=\"Let's Play\">Let's Play</a> meets <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/33_1/3\" title=\"33 1/3\">33&nbsp;1/3</a></i><span style=\"padding-left:.15em;\">\"</span>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Videogames_for_Humans","retrieved":1787680636216},{"title":"Faecalibacterium prausnitzii (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faecalibacterium_prausnitzii\" title=\"Faecalibacterium prausnitzii\">Faecalibacterium prausnitzii</a></b></i> is the most abundant single species in the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gut_microbiota\" title=\"Gut microbiota\">gut microbiota</a> of healthy adults?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faecalibacterium_prausnitzii","retrieved":1787680636219},{"title":"Clair Blank (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clair_Blank\" title=\"Clair Blank\">Clair Blank</a></b> authored 29 novels for children, but only one for adults?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clair_Blank","retrieved":1787680636220},{"title":"Flower of Mandala (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the sound of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōsaku_Yamada\" title=\"Kōsaku Yamada\">Yamada</a>'s symphonic poem <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flower_of_Mandala\" title=\"Flower of Mandala\">Flower of Mandala</a></b></i> has been described as \"almost French à la <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maurice_Ravel\" title=\"Maurice Ravel\">Ravel</a>\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flower_of_Mandala","retrieved":1787680636222},{"title":"Gabi Moura (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that after Brazilian influencer <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabi_Moura\" title=\"Gabi Moura\">Gabi Moura</a></b> was criticized for wearing a revealing dress at the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_Kentucky_Derby\" title=\"2025 Kentucky Derby\">2025 Kentucky Derby</a>, she defended herself on the basis of having large breasts?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabi_Moura","retrieved":1787680636223},{"title":"History of Llanthony Priory (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Llanthony_Priory\" title=\"History of Llanthony Priory\">History of Llanthony Priory</a></b></i> included a section intended to \"suppress the pride\" of the monks of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canterbury_Cathedral\" title=\"Canterbury Cathedral\">Canterbury Cathedral</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Llanthony_Priory","retrieved":1787680636225},{"title":"pair of walnuts (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that investors in Beijing were once willing to pay CNY<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>300,000–400,000 for a <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wenwan_walnuts\" title=\"Wenwan walnuts\">pair of walnuts</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wenwan_walnuts","retrieved":1787680636227},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;left&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Des Moines&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;DesMoinesBanner1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;A capitol building with a golden dome, several art institutions and a State Fair each August; these are some of the things awaiting you in Iowa's largest city.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-outp